  "notes": "Bee Swarm Simulator is a long-running bee collecting game made by Onett, first released in 2018. You send your bees into flower fields to gather pollen, carry it back to your hive, and turn it into honey. Honey buys new bees, tools, bags, and eggs, and quests from the bears push you further up the mountain to stronger fields and bosses.\n\nCodes give a mix of Tickets, Honey, Gumdrops, berries, boosts, and sometimes a Marshmallow Bee. Tickets are usually the most useful, because they buy Royal Jelly and Ticket items that can get you rarer bees. Onett does not update often, so new codes mostly come with big updates, the Beesmas event, and milestones like group member counts, and they are posted on X and in the Discord.",
